tions.\n- Added option to reset settings.\n- Hand poses for all interactables.\n- Updated to Unity 2021 LTS and Oculus Integration SDK v57.\n\nFIXED\n- Smooth rotation hand jitter.\n- Bullet collision effects.\n- Prevented removing gun attachments while gun is holstered.\n- Hand collider position.\n- Player physics overshoot when going on and off a ramp.\n- Inaccurate statistics.\n- NPCs bouncing after standing up.", "created_date": 1701179226, "id": "6946258522118681", "version": "0.7.0", "version_code": 92, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3695210323890200", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "7276712702406593"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1701110831, "id": "6943342589076941", "version": "0.7.0", "version_code": 91, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3695210323890200", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "7276712702406593"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1700845057, "id": "6932968750114325", "version": "0.7.0", "version_code": 90, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__is